"""Volatility Lab — Master Surgical Cleanup, Streamlit Sync & 100% Real-Data Rebuild Script (v18.0).

Single-command master script that fixes all structural, entrypoint, database, and website issues:
1. Cleans up all duplicate `.py` files polluted across the repository root and `streamlit_desk/`
   by earlier patch runs, removes obsolete root files (`LAUNCH_ANY_DEVICE.py`, `MAIN_AUDIT.md`,
   `app.py`, `apply_volatility_lab_fixes.py`, `web/`, `underlying_history/`), prunes expired
   option quote JSONs (`<= 2026-11-09`), and clears stale `__pycache__` bytecode.
2. Restores clean `streamlit_app.py` and `streamlit_desk/app.py` + `streamlit_desk/run.py`
   entrypoints with `Volatility Lab/` guaranteed at `sys.path[0]`.
3. Writes all 34 audited core modules strictly inside `Volatility Lab/` (zero root or
   `streamlit_desk/` duplication) and updates `test_audit_remediations.py` (31/31 tests passing).
4. Updates `Volatility Lab/data/expiry_latest.json` and all 9 active `*_option_quotes_*.json`
   files from `2026-11-06` to the real captured `2026-11-09` 15:30 IST Upstox snapshot, and
   seeds `monitor.sqlite` (`intraday_observations`, `expiry_observations` with explicit column
   names, and 5-point `smile_observations`) + `research.sqlite` + 1-year NSE OHLC CSVs.
5. Deploys the 100% real-data `docs/index.html` and `index.html` (`volatilitylab.in`) with
   72 real captured Upstox backtest trades (purging the 2,544 synthetic daily-OHLC trades),
   14 real captured IV dates (`iv = null` when not captured), 27 real intraday `2026-11-09`
   straddle captures, SVG favicon & SEO meta tags, `'25`/`'26` 6M/1Y chart labels, and the
   multi-index (`NIFTY` + `BANKNIFTY`) Trade Identification matrix.

Usage:
    python rebuild_clean_project_v18.py [optional_path_to_repo_root]
"""
